' Change 1662: #option StartupMethodsDisabled, AVR, with Random.
' Expected (build 1662): ";!  rcall INITSYS" and ";!  rcall INITRANDOM" in the asm, and no INITSYS or INITRANDOM
' routine. Build 1661 compiled both although they were never called.
#chip mega328p, 16
#option explicit
#option StartupMethodsDisabled

Dir PORTB Out
Randomize 0x1234
Do
    PORTB = Random
    Wait 100 ms
Loop
